{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Taskbar Farm is a minimalist idle farming simulator for your taskbar. Perfect for playing while you multitask on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326530/extras/e861267840255e63fd773f9f37cc2a76.avif?t=1747919852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326530/extras_big/e861267840255e63fd773f9f37cc2a76.avif?t=1747919852 width=800 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Farm Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a chicken and watch it lay eggs while you work. Unlock new animals as you progress, from adorable cows to fluffy sheep and truffle-hunting pigs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate and Build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy drones to help with gathering resources. Upgrade your little bots for greater efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase aviaries and barns to free up space and focus production in one place. Upgrade buildings to collect and sell products automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitasking:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Taskbar Farm is designed to sit comfortably on your taskbar, letting you manage your farm while doing other tasks, all without demanding much of your attention.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 chickens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3326530/7d7e2373ff18e044deadd630ec756c5285318f64.jpg"},{"name":"50 chickens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3326530/b075a92c65d0a30bfdfbf09b1764bd437058dc40.jpg"},{"name":"100 chickens","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3326530/7dd3c4d63d412ef3f6c48291c96e4045d33bad33.jpg